,"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids July to August and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 204% of normal in March to April and 47% of normal in September to October. Each grid listed had its driest year in 1956, as low as 37% of normal on grids 15421 and 15422.</p>"}
